      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 19,
      "npc" : "Professor Bernhard",
      "text" : "[Professor Bernhard]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 20,
      "npc" : "Professor Bernhard",
      "text" : "I would say I am Professor Bernhard, the best weapons researcher in Schwarzwald."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 22,
      "npc" : "Professor Bernhard",
      "text" : "[Professor Bernhard]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 23,
      "npc" : "Professor Bernhard",
      "text" : "After endless research I have created various weapons, but I felt something was missing so I found the ancient texts."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 24,
      "npc" : "Professor Bernhard",
      "text" : "I found out about the Dimensional Device during my research."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 26,
      "npc" : "Professor Bernhard",
      "text" : "[Professor Bernhard]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 27,
      "npc" : "Professor Bernhard",
      "text" : "I also realized that relics from the glorious past were also needed to create more powerful and superior weapons."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 28,
      "npc" : "Professor Bernhard",
      "text" : "That is why..I need you.."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 30,
      "npc" : "Professor Bernhard",
      "text" : "[Professor Bernhard]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 32,
      "npc" : "Professor Bernhard",
      "text" : "A longing for accomplishing a powerful weapon as a genuine professor!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 33,
      "npc" : "Professor Bernhard",
      "text" : "In order to accomplish that, we need shards of Gigantes that once appeared in the past battle of Fenrir and Sarah."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 35,
      "npc" : "Professor Bernhard",
      "text" : "[Professor Bernhard]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 36,
      "npc" : "Professor Bernhard",
      "text" : "I cannot leave my post."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 37,
      "npc" : "Professor Bernhard",
      "text" : "I need a warrior who can bring me the shards instead.."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 38,
      "npc" : "Professor Bernhard",
      "text" : "You seem capable."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "Professor Bernhard",
      "text" : "[Professor Bernhard]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Professor Bernhard",
      "text" : "I will continue discussing this further with your party leader rather than with you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 44,
      "npc" : "Professor Bernhard",
      "text" : "I need a warrior who can bring me the shard of Gigantes instead.."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "Professor Bernhard",
      "text" : "You seem capable."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Professor Bernhard",
      "text" : "[Professor Bernhard]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "Professor Bernhard",
      "text" : "What do you think?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "npc" : "Professor Bernhard",
      "text" : "Would you go to the past and bring me back the shards of Gigantes?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 50,
      "npc" : "Professor Bernhard",
      "text" : "I will make sure to compensate you sufficiently."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 52,
      "npc" : "Professor Bernhard",
      "text" : "No"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 52,
      "npc" : "Professor Bernhard",
      "text" : "Yes"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 53,
      "npc" : "Professor Bernhard",
      "text" : "[Professor Bernhard]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 54,
      "npc" : "Professor Bernhard",
      "text" : "Visit me again if you change your mind."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Professor Bernhard",
      "text" : "[Professor Bernhard]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 58,
      "npc" : "Professor Bernhard",
      "text" : "I set the Dimensional Device to Glast Heim of the past, where Fenrir and Sarah once fought."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Professor Bernhard",
      "text" : "The operating time isn't long so hurry up and come back."
